  "theorem_statement": "The mod-12 wheel is the common finite interface of the decimal reptend, toroidal genus gate, stabilizer quarter-turn, and W(3,3) atoms. Its quarter boundaries are {3,6,9,12}={q,2q,q^2,k}; its toroidal residues are {3,4,7,12}={q,q+1,Phi6,k}; its decimal partition is {1,2,4,5,8} plus {7} plus {3,6,9}; and its stabilizer cycle is 1->5->12->8->1.",
